# KBC Care mobile - copy to .env (git-ignored) and adjust. Never put credentials here:
# every EXPO_PUBLIC_* value is compiled into the app bundle and readable by anyone.
#
# Server root WITHOUT /api. Leave empty to auto-detect:
#   phone with Expo Go -> http://<IP of the computer running `npx expo start`>:8000
#   Android emulator   -> http://10.0.2.2:8000
#   iOS simulator/web  -> http://127.0.0.1:8000 (web: same host name as the page)
# Examples:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.23:8000
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://<your-cloud-run-service>.run.app
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
